  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: \"2.4.0\"\n  major_minor_version: ${{ (version | split('.'))[:2] | join('.') }}\n\npackage:\n  name: fast-cdr\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/eProsima/Fast-CDR/archive/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 79d8466107dd6b7d1defe961c4aa31735038937cf9dd1175cf6b0da0df2209ab\n  patches:\n    - 0001-check-compiler-warnings-with-ninja.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - cmake >=3.22\n    - ninja\n    - pkg-config\n  host:\n    - gtest\n  ignore_run_exports:\n    by_name:\n      - gtest\n  run_exports:\n    - ${{ pin_subpackage('fast-cdr', upper_bound='x.x') }}\n\ntests:\n  - package_contents:\n      lib:\n        - if: win\n          then: fastcdr-${{ major_minor_version }}\n          else: fastcdr\n      include:\n        - fastcdr/Cdr.h\n        - fastcdr/FastBuffer.h\n      files:\n        - if: linux\n          then: lib/libfastcdr.so.${{ version }}\n\n  - requirements:\n      run:\n        - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n        - cmake >=3.22\n        - ninja\n    files:\n      recipe:\n        - cmake_test/\n    script:\n      - if: unix\n        then: cmake -S cmake_test -B consumer -G Ninja $CMAKE_ARGS\n        else: cmake -S cmake_test -B consumer -G Ninja %CMAKE_ARGS%\n      - cmake --build consumer\n      - ctest --test-dir consumer --output-on-failure\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://github.com/eProsima/Fast-CDR\n  license: Apache-2.0\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  summary: eProsima Fast CDR\n  description: |\n    eProsima Fast CDR provides standard CDR serialization and a faster\n    implementation of the same mechanism.\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - seanyen\n    - wolfv\n    - MiguelCompany\n    - EduPonz\n",
